  #line-at(368.638pt, 128.78pt, "corresponding ")
  #line-at(436.595pt, 128.78pt, "to ")
  #line-at(455.29pt, 128.78pt, "enhancement ")
  #line-at(518.825pt, 128.78pt, "factors ")
  #line-at(556.812pt, 128.78pt, "of ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 140.3pt, "approximately 23 and 21 times, respectively. The nonlinear ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 151.7pt, "increase in photocurrent with voltage, which is significantly ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 163.22pt, "larger than the corresponding increase in dark current, ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 174.74pt, "demonstrates a high photoconductive gain regime at elevated ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 186.26pt, "electric fields. ")
  #line-at(323.35pt, 197.78pt, "Furthermore, Figs. 4(a) and 4(b) show the temporal ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 209.3pt, "photocurrent response of the two devices under CW ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 220.7pt, "illumination at bias voltages of 300, 400, and 425 V. At low ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 232.22pt, "bias (300 V), the photocurrent exhibits a small and slowly ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 243.74pt, "varying response, consistent with limited carrier extraction ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 255.29pt, "under a moderate electric field. As the bias increases to 400 V ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 266.81pt, "and 425 V, a pronounced transient peak is followed by a gradual ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 278.33pt, "decay to a steady-state level. Both the peak amplitude and the ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 289.73pt, "steady-state photocurrent increase strongly with bias, indicating ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 301.25pt, "enhanced carrier generation and transport at high electric fields. ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 312.77pt, "The presence of a bias-dependent decay component suggests ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 324.29pt, "trap-mediated carrier dynamics, where rapid initial photo ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 335.81pt, "response is followed by carrier trapping and re-equilibration. ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 347.21pt, "The similar temporal behavior observed in both devices further ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 358.73pt, "confirms that the high-gain response arises from bulk transport ")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 370.25pt, "mechanisms rather than measurement artifacts or contact-")
  #line-at(313.25pt, 381.77pt, "limited effects. ")
